{"id":"53219","nombre":"Shakshuka con queso feta","original":"Shakshuka Feta Cheese","categoria":"Miscellaneous","origen":"Arabia Saudita","imagen":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wpkfin1763597958.jpg","video":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xaBo3BxKzp8","enlace":"https://cookpad.com/eng/recipes/22551672?ref=search&search_term=saudi+arabia","etiquetas":["Con queso"],"ingredientes":[["Huevo","4 grandes","Egg"],["Salsa de tomate","3 cdas","Tomato Sauce"],["Aceite de oliva","1 cda","Olive Oil"],["Echalotes","1 picado","Shallots"],["Apio","1","Celery"],["Ajo","1 diente pelado y machacado","Garlic"],["Espinaca","1 taza","Spinach"],["Queso feta","1/2 taza","Feta"],["Morrón rojo","1/2","Red Pepper"],["Comino molido","1 cdta","Ground Cumin"],["Sal","1/2 cdta","Salt"],["Pimienta negra","1/2 cdta","Black Pepper"]],"pasos":["Calentar una cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén a fuego medio-fuerte.","Agregar las verduras picadas: cebolla, ajo, apio y morrón rojo. Rehogar todo junto 5 minutos.","Agregar el comino, sal, pimienta y la salsa de tomate y cocinar 7 minutos más.","Agregar los huevos, tapar y cocinar 8 minutos. Al final, agregar la espinaca fresca y el queso feta.","Servir con pan fresco."]}